  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements:</strong> You must have at least one tempered ur-stone worn against your skin</p><p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1 Resolve</p><p><strong>Range:</strong> Touch</p><p>You draw the energy out of another creature and into your jade, using its power to invigorate yourself.</p><p>Choose an adjacent target and make a <strong>4:1 Soul (Metaphysics</strong>) check, opposed by the target's <strong>Resilience</strong>.</p><p>If the target fails the opposed check, it takes <strong>Damage</strong> equal to the difference in successes. This <strong>Damage</strong> ignores <strong>Armor</strong>.</p><p>Additionally, your <strong>Body</strong> increases by <strong>+1</strong> until the start of your next turn.</p><p>You may spend <strong>1 Resolve</strong> at the start of your turn to sustain this effect.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.b4E5gS5yiaUq1HBt]{Jade Drain}</p>",
